-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",33,{
[1025]="700173D5\n1\tBring the message to Veúlfur in the Twenty-first Hall\030Collect Message from Mazog\tThere might be a dwarf who can help with the note in the Twenty-first Hall. The note seems to indicate that General Talug has some measure of both fear and apprehension of what lay in the deep dark places of Moria.\n",
[1026]="700461B4\n1\tThe horse to after-battle Minas Tirith can be found in the Threshold of the City, or in Minas Tirith pre-battle. Take the horse to after-battle Minas Tirith so that you may meet with Imrahil.\t\n2\tTake the horse to Minas Tirith, After the Battle\tThe horse to after-battle Minas Tirith can be found in the Threshold of the City, or in Minas Tirith pre-battle. Take the horse to after-battle Minas Tirith so that you may meet with Imrahil.\n3\tSpeak with Imrahil\tImrahil can be found just outside the walls of Minas Tirith. You should speak with Imrahil.\n",
[1027]="70058C90\n1\tFind Múta at Caivád Sâr\tMúta can be found somewhere near Caivád Sâr in northern Elderslade. Glóin has asked you to rally with one of his scouts, Múta, near the Angmarim settlement of Caivád Sâr. You should travel north and find Múta.\n2\tTalk to Múta at Caivád Sâr\tMúta can be found outside Caivád Sâr in northern Elderslade. You have found Múta and you should now talk to her.\n",
[1028]="7002D41C\n1\tDefeat goblins at Gloku-ru (total: 8)\tThe goblin camp at Gloku-ru is south and slightly west of the entrance to Zirakzigil and the Door to the Clouds. Kalman has asked you to defeat goblins that burned the encampment that once stood at Gloku-ru.\n2\tTalk to Gerwith at Tharâkh Bazân\tTharâkh Bazân is north and east of Gloku-ru. You have been asked to report to Gerwith at Tharâkh Bazân with your success at Gloku-ru.\n",
[1029]="7006565E\n1\tChop firewood (total: 3)\030Pull weeds (total: 4)\tTornir has asked you to chop firewood and pull weeds in his yard. His home is located in Glaniath.\n2\tTalk to Tornir\tYou have completed Tornir's tasks and should let him know. He can be found outside his house in Glaniath.\n",
[1030]="70061CAA\n1\tDeliver the small food portion to the unruly prisoner in the left-hand cell in the dungeons\tThe ill-tempered Uruk gave you a small food portion to deliver to an unruly prisoner in the left-hand cell in the dungeons.\n2\tWait... can it be?\tThe prisoner seems somehow familiar to you.\n3\tTalk to Egfrith beneath Isengard\tEgfrith has been imprisoned beneath Isengard, despite her betrayal of Rohan.\n",
[1031]="70061CA8\n1\tGorwen stands by a number of recently-constructed cairns outside the village of Tornhad, remembering those who were lost at Sarn Ford and in Tyrn Gorthad.\t\n2\tTalk to Gorwen by the cairns in Tornhad\tGorwen stands by a number of recently-constructed cairns in the village of Tornhad, remembering those who were lost at Sarn Ford and beneath Dol Ernil.\n",
[1032]="70054887\n1\tYou are fated to labour in service to the Dark Lord.\t\n2\tDefeat rats (total: 10)\030Defeat maggots (total: 3)\tMaggots and rats can be found throughout the dungeons of Barad-dûr.\n",
[1033]="7003FEAF\n1\tSearch for evidence of mauled animals outside Alagrant\tYou can likely find slain creatures to the east of Alagrant, across the Blackroot. Sarnir has asked you to investigate the mauled animals that have been appearing near Alagrant.\n2\tExamine the mauled bear\tThe bear corpse you discovered can be found directly east of Alagrant. You have discovered a mauled bear corpse in the field of Blackroot Vale, and should examine it to determine what brought about its demise.\n3\tTalk to Sarnir\tSarnir can be found in Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale. You have managed to survive a brutal attack after finding a mauled bear in the vale. You should report what you have found to Sarnir.\n",
[1034]="7000EAAA\n1\tCollect bear-fur (total: 18)\tBears can be found south of Sûri-kylä across the ice bay. Nôra has asked you to help supply the village of Sûri-kylä for the winter by collecting bear-fur.\n2\tTalk to Nôra\030Collect Bear-fur (total: 18)\tNôra is at Sûri-kylä. You should take the furs you collected to Nôra.\n",
[1035]="70030DD4\n1\tTalk to a Croft-guard to the north of Snowbourn\tThe first Croft-guard can be found near the silo to the north of Snowbourn. Ecgar has asked you to aid the Croft-guards in the fields of Snowbourn.\n2\tDefeat Orcs at the northern silo (total: 4)\tOrcs can be found at the silo to the north of Snowbourn. You should help the croft-guard defeat the Orcs attacking the northern silo.\n3\tTalk to a croft-guard to the east of Snowbourn\tThe second croft-guard can be found near the silo directly east of Snowbourn. Ecgar has asked you to aid the croft-guards in the fields of Snowbourn.\n4\tDefeat Orcs at the eastern silo (total: 4)\tOrcs can be found at the silo to the east of Snowbourn. You should help the croft-guard defend the eastern silo.\n5\tTalk to a croft-guard to the south-east of Snowbourn\tThe last croft-guard can be found at the silo to the south-east of Snowbourn. Ecgar has asked you to aid the Croft-guards in the fields of Snowbourn.\n6\tDefeat Orcs at the south-eastern silo (total: 4)\tOrcs can be found fighting with Rohirrim near the south-eastern silo. You should help the croft-guard defend the south-eastern silo against the Orcs.\n7\tTalk to Ecgar\tEcgar can be found in central Snowbourn. You should return to Ecgar and let him know that you have done as he asked.\n",
[1036]="7000B990\n1\tDefeat tempest Wargs (total: 10)\tThe Wargs occupy the giant-ruins in the north-east part of the High-pass. Nogmeldir has asked you to do battle with the Wargs to test their strength and numbers.\n2\tTalk to Nogmeldir\tNogmeldir is at Vindurhal, west of the giant-ruins. You should return to Nogmeldir and tell him what you have learned of the tempest Wargs.\n",
[1037]="7004A8F7\n1\tSet fires in Cirith Ungol to repel Shelob's brood (total: 10)\tRuined scraps of wood and wreckage can be found throughout Cirith Ungol. Legolas has asked you to set fires in Cirith Ungol to repel the spiders of Shelob's brood.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have set many fires within Cirith Ungol.\n",
[1038]="7000AC03\n1\tTalk to Gelbes at Glân Vraig\tGelbes is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors. Speak with her to call a ranger to the Ettenmoors. The Rangers will assist in retaking Lugazag, but they request that you take the place of a Ranger in Eriador while they come to the Ettenmoors to fight in your stead.\n2\tTalk to Gelbes\tGelbes is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors. A Ranger came to the Ettenmoors in your stead and fought valiantly, while you patrolled Eriador in his stead. You should now return to Gelbes.\n",
[1039]="7006001A\n1\tBurn Iron Crown banners at Agal Dûn\tAgal Dûn can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should burn Iron Crown banners at Agal Dûn.\n2\tBurn Iron Crown banners at Agal Dûn (total: 12)\tAgal Dûn can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should burn Iron Crown banners at Agal Dûn.\n",
[1040]="70060016\n1\tDestroy altars and supplies at Agal Dûn\tAgal Dûn can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should destroy altars and supplies at Agal Dûn.\n2\tDestroy Angmarim altars (total: 6)\030Destroy Iron Crown supplies (total: 8)\tAgal Dûn can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should destroy altars and supplies at Agal Dûn.\n",
[1041]="7004C415\n1\tTalk to Lansu\t\n",
[1042]="7000A8B8\n1\tDefeat Agarochir\tAgarochir can be found in the courtyard of Tirband at the base of the great watch-tower, on the highest level of the city. Eirieniel has asked you to defeat Agarochir, one of Amarthiel's Black Númenórean lieutenants so the Rangers may be able to seize the court of Tirband.\n2\tTalk to Eirieniel\tEirieniel is at Echad Garthadir. You have defeated Agarochir, one of Amarthiel's Black Númenórean lieutenants, and should bring news of your victory to Eirieniel.\n",
[1043]="70037338\n1\tScout towards the road to the west\030Scout the road to the east\030Scout the river to the south-east\tThe east road should be scouted by heading east and then south from the refugees' camp. The west road should be scouted by heading west through the woods. The river should be scouted by heading directly south-east. Agelwyn has asked you to scout possible routes towards Helm's Deep: the road to the west, the road to the east, and the along the river banks.\n2\tReturn to Agelwyn with your report\tAgelwyn can be found in the refugees' hiding spot north of Marton. You should return to Agelwyn.\n",
[1044]="70059910\n1\tComplete 'Agoroth, the Narrowdelve' on any difficulty\tComplete 'Agoroth, the Narrowdelve' on any difficulty. Use the Instance Finder to enter Agoroth, the Narrowdelve.\n2\tTalk to Lothrandir\tThe Angmarim have been defeated and the Helcessar destroyed. You should speak to Lothrandir. He can be found inside Agoroth, inside Jä-reitti, or at the shipwreck of the Thoroval.\n3\tTalk to Arvedui\tThe Angmarim have been defeated and the Helcessar destroyed. You should speak to Arvedui. He can be found inside Agoroth, inside Jä-reitti, or at the shipwreck of the Thoroval.\n4\tTalk to Elrond\tYou have won a great victory against Angmar and freed Arvedui from his fate. You should return to Elrond in Rivendell and inform him of your success.\n",
[1045]="7005973E\n1\tPick up the summoning horn\tYou have arrived inside the Narrowdelve. You should pick up the summoning horn. It will allow you to call Lothrandir to your side.\n2\tDefeat Rúcrog Hoarpelt\030Defeat Aigrith the Ashen\tThe Angmarim and Gauredain are attempting to breach Agoroth. You should defeat their leaders: Rúcrog Hoarpelt and Aigrith the Ashen. If you need assistance, use the Call Lothrandir skill to call Lothrandir to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.\n3\tWitness the vision of Arvedui's demise\tAgoroth has been secured, but the Helcessar remains. Witness events as they unfold!\n",
[1046]="7005973D\n1\tDefeat Rúcrog Hoarpelt\030Defeat Aigrith the Ashen\tThe Angmarim and Gauredain are attempting to breach Agoroth. You should defeat their leaders: Rúcrog Hoarpelt and Aigrith the Ashen.\n2\tWitness the vision of Arvedui's demise\tAgoroth has been secured, but the Helcessar remains. Witness events as they unfold!\n",
[1047]="70059740\n1\tDefeat Rúcrog Hoarpelt\030Defeat Aigrith the Ashen\tThe Angmarim and Gauredain are attempting to breach Agoroth. You should defeat their leaders: Rúcrog Hoarpelt and Aigrith the Ashen.\n2\tWitness the vision of Arvedui's demise\tAgoroth has been secured, but the Helcessar remains. Witness events as they unfold!\n",
[1048]="7005973F\n1\tDefeat Rúcrog Hoarpelt\030Defeat Aigrith the Ashen\tThe Angmarim and Gauredain are attempting to breach Agoroth. You should defeat their leaders: Rúcrog Hoarpelt and Aigrith the Ashen.\n2\tWitness the vision of Arvedui's demise\tAgoroth has been secured, but the Helcessar remains. Witness events as they unfold!\n",
[1049]="70037B6A\n1\tArrow bundles can be retrieved from the market, iron bars from the miners, wood planks near the farm-house, and food from inside the farm-house. Herubrand asked you to gather supplies for Brockbridge.\t\n2\tBring supplies to Herefara in Brockbridge\tBrockbridge is south and a little east of Woodhurst. Herubrand has asked you to take the supplies to Brockbridge and support his son Herefara.\n",
[1050]="70046C33\n1\tFill water-skins in the waters of the river east of Aelin Veren (total: 4)\030Travel east to the source of the river flowing through Aelin Veren\tThe river that flows through Aelin Veren can be found in central North Ithilien. Maendal has asked you to fill water-skins in the eastern waters of the river flowing through Aelin Veren before giving them to the prisoners.\n2\tThe Haradrim prisoners can be found at Aelin Veren, in central North Ithilien. You have returned with the filled water-skins and should now offer them to the Haradrim prisoners.\t\n3\tTalk to Maendal\tMaendal can be found at Aelin Veren in central North Ithilien. You have offered a water-skin to each of the prisoners and should now speak to Maendal.\n",
[1051]="700300F3\n1\tTalk to Cíllan\tCíllan is at the refugees' camp outside of Harwick. You should find Cíllan and see how she fares.\n2\tSomeone in Harwick must deal with the acquisition of houses in the city. You should speak with people in Harwick who may have homes for sale, so that she may begin to move her people out of the refugee camp and into more permanent homes.\t\n3\tReturn to Cíllan in the refugee camp\tCíllan is waiting in the refugee camp outside Harwick to find out if there are any houses available for purchase in Harwick. You should tell Cíllan everything you found out.\n",
[1052]="70015E25\n1\tTalk to Glavroleth at Echad Dúnann\tEchad Dúnann lies along the road south and east from Echad Eregion, in Nan Sirannon. Lengliel has asked you to seek out Glavroleth at Echad Dúnann.\n",
[1053]="7000AB9D\n1\tSpeak with Uirnen and complete your patrol of the Ettenmoors as a Ranger (Cost: 500 Commendations)\tUirnen is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors. The Rangers are attempting to augment the forces fighting in the Ettenmoors, but fear that committing too much to the battle will result in Angmar succeeding elsewhere. The Ranger Uirnen has asked you to speak with him if you wish to assist the Rangers with their duties.\n2\tTalk to Uirnen at Glân Vraig\tUirnen is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors. You should return to Uirnen and inform him that you have fulfilled your duty.\n",
[1054]="700375BC\n1\tTalk to Lúfa\030Talk to Reeve Fríthbert\030Talk to Edhild\tLúfa, Edhild, and Reeve Fríthbert are in the Mead Hall of Stoke. Thane Torferth told you that Lúfa and the children wished to say their farewells to you before you depart.\n2\tTalk to Torferth\tThane Torferth is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should speak with Thane Torferth again.\n3\tTalk to Léoflac\tA herald from the Stonedeans arrived in the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should speak with the herald from the Stonedeans.\n4\tFind someone near Woodhurst who might have some insight into the Stonedeans' travails\tWoodhurst lies to the north-west of Stoke, in the Stonedeans. You should find someone near Woodhurst who might give you some insight into the situation in the Stonedeans.\n",
[1055]="7001BFC6\n1\tDeliver the treasures to Cwendreda at Dol Vaeg\030Collect valuable treasures (total: 8)\tNan Dhelu lies to the north of the ruins of Dol Vaeg. Cwendreda has asked you to keep a watchful eye out for any treasures that you may find within the ruins of Nan Dehlu. She believes that the wights within the ruins may carry them.\n",
[1056]="7006BB27\n1\tReach the Ashâgir hideout in the cliffs\tGûzinir has asked you to go to Ashâgir and see if there are any refugees remaining there as they may be in need of help.\n2\tSpeak with a nearby Ashâgir refugee\tYou found the refugees who remained in Ashâgir. Ask one of them if the are in need of help.\n",
})
